      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "WHEN BE FIXED THIS? If there is a serious invalid tag in an important OGP for SNS, it will cause problems when sharing on SNS or websites. What are you doing leaving such a serious problem for a year? Because of this, OGP cannot be displayed correctly on mixi.social, a new SNS that an acquaintance of mine is developing.",
